        <mxCell id="data-note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Medallion data architecture&lt;/b&gt;: landing → bronze → silver → gold &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; one command, &lt;i&gt;verra build&lt;/i&gt;, with its settings in pipeline.toml &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; every layer is kept per snapshot date, and a re-run writes byte-identical files&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Readers see only finished snapshots&lt;/b&gt;: gold is written only when every error check passes, and the manifest is written last &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; SQL: &lt;i&gt;verra query&lt;/i&gt; &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;On Google Cloud&lt;/b&gt;: one Cloud Run job, one Cloud Run dashboard, one Cloud Storage bucket" vertex="1">
